rl="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134290446,imgsize-970469.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[18-year-old builds $130 system to detect bedsores]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134266149.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[At just eighteen, Maya Trutschl has created a pioneering system that utilizes machine learning and thermal imaging to detect early signs of pressure injuries. This innovative approach not only helps prevent bedsores but also provides timely alerts to nursing staff, enhancing patient care. Her remarkable achievement has won her a prestigious scholarship, fueling her ambition to innovate further and tackle significant challenges in healthcare through intelligent engineering solutions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-maya-trutschl-the-18-year-old-louisiana-student-who-built-a-130-system-that-detects-bedsores-before-they-form-in-icu-patients-using-machine-learning-and-thermal-cameras-wins-a-25000-scholarship/articleshow/134266149.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-maya-trutschl-the-18-year-old-louisiana-student-who-built-a-130-system-that-detects-bedsores-before-they-form-in-icu-patients-using-machine-learning-and-thermal-cameras-wins-a-25000-scholarship/articleshow/134266149.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T19:58:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134266307,imgsize-382125.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[From bravado to busted bases: Hidden cost of US-Iran war revealed]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134290064.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/from-bravado-to-busted-bases-hidden-cost-of-us-iran-war-revealed/articleshow/134290064.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/from-bravado-to-busted-bases-hidden-cost-of-us-iran-war-revealed/articleshow/134290064.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T19:46:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Chidanand Rajghatta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134290141,imgsize-1221038.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Gold mine collapses in Sudan: At least 82 workers killed, many more feared trapped]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134284631.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A catastrophic collapse at a gold mine in Sudan's West Kordofan region has resulted in the tragic loss of at least sixty lives, with many others still unaccounted for and feared trapped under debris. This incident underscores the severe risks faced by artisanal miners, exacerbated by inadequate safety measures and emergency resources. Moreover, the gold mining sector in Sudan is entangled with ongoing conflicts, forcing individuals into perilous mining endeavors.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/gold-mine-collapses-in-sudan-at-least-60-workers-killed-many-more-feared-trapped/articleshow/134284631.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/gold-mine-collapses-in-sudan-at-least-60-workers-killed-many-more-feared-trapped/articleshow/134284631.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T16:03:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134285154,imgsize-139014.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump admin cuts $177 billion in federal grants across all 50 US states: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134289558.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-admin-cuts-177-billion-in-federal-grants-across-all-50-us-states-report/articleshow/134289558.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-admin-cuts-177-billion-in-federal-grants-across-all-50-us-states-report/articleshow/134289558.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T19:22:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134289639,imgsize-56432.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Brad Pitt let his neighbour live rent-free until 105; the unusual story behind his former LA mansion]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134289164.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a heartwarming gesture, Brad Pitt purchased a home from an elderly neighbor, allowing him to live there rent-free until he reached the remarkable age of 105. Over the years, Pitt amassed several properties to form his Los Feliz compound, displaying a keen interest in architecture. Recently, he sold his estate in Los Feliz for around $33 million, marking a significant milestone in his real estate journey.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1994-brad-pitt-bought-a-1-7-million-mansion-in-los-angeles-and-later-his-neighbors-house-to-expand-his-property-then-the-actor-let-a-widower-live-there-rent-free-until-he-died-at-105/articleshow/134289164.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1994-brad-pitt-bought-a-1-7-million-mansion-in-los-angeles-and-later-his-neighbors-house-to-expand-his-property-then-the-actor-let-a-widower-live-there-rent-free-until-he-died-at-105/articleshow/134289164.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T19:08:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134289402,imgsize-1648017.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Viral Picnic Faces Big Bill: casual invite draws 500 RSVPs; permits may cost $4,000]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134287251.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[What began as a casual picnic invitation in San Francisco has blossomed into a sprawling celebration attracting hundreds. The surge in interest led to the need for permits and enhanced safety measures, resulting in hefty costs for the organizer. Fortunately, Partiful has stepped in to cover these expenses, turning the picnic into a vibrant friendship festival for all attendees.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-san-francisco-woman-invited-strangers-to-a-simple-park-picnic-more-than-500-said-yes-and-city-rules-pushed-the-estimated-cost-to-as-much-as-4000/articleshow/134287251.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-san-francisco-woman-invited-strangers-to-a-simple-park-picnic-more-than-500-said-yes-and-city-rules-pushed-the-estimated-cost-to-as-much-as-4000/articleshow/134287251.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T19:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134287341,imgsize-1182828.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Former MLB all-star James Shields’ custom estate lists for $23M]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134288386.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/former-mlb-all-star-james-shields-turned-a-1-8-million-california-lot-into-a-13515-sq-ft-custom-estate-the-2-44-acre-property-is-now-asking-23-million/articleshow/134288386.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/former-mlb-all-star-james-shields-turned-a-1-8-million-california-lot-into-a-13515-sq-ft-custom-estate-the-2-44-acre-property-is-now-asking-23-million/articleshow/134288386.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T19:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134288496,imgsize-696047.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[How a Florida man’s private AI conversations led to an FBI investigation]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134288456.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A former analyst from Goldman Sachs faces repercussions after admitting to using ChatGPT to threaten his ex-girlfriend. He pleaded guilty to charges of stalking and making written threats to kill. OpenAI intervened by notifying federal officials upon recognizing alarming dialogue. Zhou has been sentenced to eight years of probation along with electronic monitoring, shedding light on the implications of AI in criminal cases and raising concerns regarding user privacy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/he-told-chatgpt-he-wanted-to-kill-his-ex-girlfriend-how-a-florida-mans-private-ai-conversations-led-to-an-fbi-investigation/articleshow/134288456.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/he-told-chatgpt-he-wanted-to-kill-his-ex-girlfriend-how-a-florida-mans-private-ai-conversations-led-to-an-fbi-investigation/articleshow/134288456.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T18:46:39+05: