ia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2012-an-idaho-man-built-one-bed-in-his-garage-for-a-child-sleeping-on-the-floor-14-years-later-the-idea-has-delivered-nearly-396000-beds-through-400-chapters/articleshow/134285610.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2012-an-idaho-man-built-one-bed-in-his-garage-for-a-child-sleeping-on-the-floor-14-years-later-the-idea-has-delivered-nearly-396000-beds-through-400-chapters/articleshow/134285610.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T17:56:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134285830,imgsize-1840451.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Cow Creek Wildfire: Florida forest rebounds with flowers and pollinators; shows fire-shaped ecology]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134281339.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[After a recent wildfire, Florida's Goethe State Forest has experienced a vibrant resurgence of wildflowers and grasses. These native plants, adapted to thrive post-fire, regrow vigorously from their roots. This rejuvenation not only revives the landscape but also offers new food and nesting opportunities for returning insects, highlighting a powerful, enduring cycle of fire-induced renewal in Florida’s rich ecosystem.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/in-april-a-florida-wildfire-burned-a-forest-almost-three-times-the-size-of-central-park-within-months-wildflowers-covered-the-ash-and-pollinators-returned-in-droves/articleshow/134281339.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/in-april-a-florida-wildfire-burned-a-forest-almost-three-times-the-size-of-central-park-within-months-wildflowers-covered-the-ash-and-pollinators-returned-in-droves/articleshow/134281339.cms]]></guid><pubDate